===== README.md =====
# Shop Monorepo

## 架构边界（团队约定）

- apps/web 与 apps/admin 是两个独立前端；**admin 不得依赖 apps/web 的业务代码，跨端复用一律走 packages/**。
- packages/ 只放与端无关的逻辑与组件。
===== package.json =====
{"name":"shop-monorepo","private":true,"workspaces":["apps/*","packages/*"]}
===== apps/admin/package.json =====
{"name":"admin","dependencies":{"@shop/api-client":"0.0.1"}}
===== apps/web/package.json =====
{"name":"web","dependencies":{"@shop/api-client":"0.0.1","@shop/ui":"0.0.1"}}
===== packages/api-client/package.json =====
{"name":"@shop/api-client","version":"0.0.1","main":"index.ts"}
===== packages/ui/package.json =====
{"name":"@shop/ui","version":"0.0.1","main":"index.ts"}

